  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 8 Question 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Why can't a true believer lose his or her salvation?
  answers:
  - Because God Himself preserves them
  - Because they did all the right things
  - Because their pastor said so
  - They can lose their salvation
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  discussionAnswer: God personally preserves Christians to the end.  God, who is
    the strongest and who cannot lie, has promised eternal security for all believers
    in His Word - He will never let one of His people lose their salvation, and no
    one can force them out of His hand.
